# bench output. Screenshots and logs are regenerable noise; a results file is EVIDENCE.
#
# `bench/**/results*.json` was ignored here on the reasoning that numbers belong in docs/ with
# their harness named. That was wrong in one direction: docs/CONSTRAINTS.md 51, 54 and 56 cite
# bench/syscall-contention/results-sweep.json by path, and a citation that resolves to an ignored
# file is not a citation. The numbers do belong in docs/ — and the artifact they were read out of
# has to be in the tree for anyone to check them.
bench/**/shot.png
bench/**/*.png
*.log

# rendered mockup screenshots: regenerate with mockups/shoot.py
mockups/*.png
